@startuml RF43_Sequencia
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam titleFontSize 15
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam ArrowColor #52606D
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDEB
  BorderColor #D8CE78
  FontColor #554F24
}
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
  ActorBorderColor #4A4852
  GroupBorderColor #CBC6BE
  GroupBackgroundColor #FAF8F5
}
autonumber "<b>0."
title RF43 — Autopiloto gera combinações de vestimentas com IA de acordo com as especificações do usuário\nDiagrama de sequência — gerado do código em 2026-10-06 (scripts/diagramas/v5)

actor "Pessoa usuária" as U
boundary "Tela /autopilot" as P
control "AutopilotController" as AutopilotController
participant "AutopilotService" as AutopilotService
participant "WardrobeService" as WardrobeService
database "MySQL" as DB_MySQL
participant "WeatherService" as WeatherService
participant "LookScorer" as LookScorer
== Planejar a semana (um look por dia sem repetir peças) ==
U -> P : Planejar a semana (um look por dia sem repetir pe…
P -> AutopilotController : POST /api/autopilot/weeks
AutopilotController -> AutopilotService : planWeek()
activate AutopilotService
AutopilotService -> WardrobeService : eligible()
WardrobeService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT wardrobe_items
WardrobeService --> AutopilotService
alt acervo insuficiente
AutopilotService --> AutopilotController : 422 ACERVO_INSUFICIENTE
AutopilotController --> P : 422 + mensagem
end
AutopilotService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT week_plans
AutopilotService -> AutopilotService : status = DISCARDED
AutopilotService -> DB_MySQL : INSERT/UPDATE week_plans
AutopilotService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT users
AutopilotService -> AutopilotService : new WeekPlan()
AutopilotService -> AutopilotService : status = ACTIVE
AutopilotService -> DB_MySQL : INSERT/UPDATE week_plans
AutopilotService -> WeatherService : resolve()
AutopilotService -> AutopilotService : new WeekPlanDay()
AutopilotService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT wardrobe_items
AutopilotService -> AutopilotService : combinationKey = set
AutopilotService -> DB_MySQL : INSERT/UPDATE week_plan_days
AutopilotService -> DB_MySQL : INSERT/UPDATE week_plans
AutopilotService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT week_plan_days
AutopilotService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT wardrobe_items
AutopilotService -> LookScorer : scoreLooks()
LookScorer -> DB_MySQL : SELECT style_dna
LookScorer -> DB_MySQL : SELECT schemes
LookScorer -> DB_MySQL : SELECT scheme_items
LookScorer --> AutopilotService
deactivate AutopilotService
AutopilotService --> AutopilotController : resultado
AutopilotController --> P : 201 JSON
P --> U : atualiza a tela
@enduml
